<title>USA: TENNIS-MEN'S RESULTS IN SAN JOSE SATURDAY.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-MEN'S RESULTS IN SAN JOSE SATURDAY.</headline>
<dateline>SAN JOSE, California 1997-02-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the</p>
<p>$303,000 Sybase Open tennis tournament on Saturday (prefix</p>
<p>number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Semifinals:</p>
<p>1-Pete Sampras (U.S.) beat 4-Todd Martin (U.S.) 6-2 6-3</p>
<p>7-Greg Rusedski (Britain) beat 3-Andre Agassi (U.S.) 6-3 6-4</p>
</text>
